ond the follow-ups below.\n\n— Action items —\n• Imani Okafor — make the temporary rate-limit change permanent; close out alert tuning.\n• Hannah Brooks — dashboard and runbook updates for the error-rate alert.\n• Tomas Reyes — edge health-check config fix; load-balancer retry settings cleanup.\n• Rowan Patel — draft the public post-mortem; publish within two weeks through the standard publication process.\n\n— End of summary —",
